        <activityName xml:lang="en">Rape seed, organic, at farm</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Rape seed, organic, at farm
Inventory refers to the production of 1 kg  rape seed, organic, at farm with 6% moisture.  Fresh matter yield at 6 % moisture: 2023 kg/ha.;
UUID: a9b85866-a5b7-3b25-9c14-2a4d20fe5c91
The inventories include the soil cultivation, fertilization, harvest, drying and transport to the farm
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Intensive organic production.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data were compiled from study areas, statistics, fertilising recommendations, documents from extension services and expert knowledge. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a9b85866-a5b7-3b25-9c14-2a4d20fe5c91.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
